  "graph_delta": "Two public compiled positive-complex-lift declarations;26 private providers owned by the accepted shared declaration, not separate progress claims. Same real D=I-T*T internally produced by actual PBPS59. Four affected module graph artifacts and two new enriched module cards.63 canonical card metadata preserved,80 unrelated generated files restored, current511 production module inventory retained. No new real root/GammaP/functor.",
  "remaining": "No root, real descent of complex CFC root, uniqueness, Gamma0/B15/B16, weakH1/dynamics/main/error/querycost/composition, paper or Goal closure. Reader seal/main/live/postmerge purification and complete Goal open.",
